<Layout title="Talking to Strangers Reduces Stress — Science-Backed Benefits | Airwalk Blog" description="Research shows talking to strangers lowers cortisol, reduces anxiety, and improves mental health. Learn how anonymous voice chat helps you decompress.">
  <header class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-800">
